================================================================================
Prompt: check_chapter.j2
Service Step: CHECK_CHAPTER (Chapter Quality Check)
Function Summary: Perform internal chapter quality check and prompt misreading risk assessment on chapter body text, output risk level and actionable repair action list.
Upstream Input:
  - chapter_number/chapter_text: Chapter body from Draft/Edit step output
  - canon_context.characters: Current character states from CanonStore
  - character_profiles: Authoritative character archives from CharacterBible
  - previous_chapter_ending: Background input only; this task does not review cross-chapter continuity
  - known_prompt_markers: Known system marker vocabulary from PromptBuilder
  - creative_contract: Lightweight creative acceptance contract from chapter planning (scene_id/summary/emotional_beat/sensory_focus/dialogue_subtext)
  - local_detected_prompt_leaks: High-confidence leak items from local pre-check
  - local_forbidden_element_candidates: String-recalled forbidden element candidates requiring semantic judgment
  - previous_report: Output from previous round of CHECK_CHAPTER (delta recheck mode)
  - changed_sections: Pre/post-repair segments from ContinuityRepair (delta mode)
Downstream Output:
  - JSON: {"risk_level", "summary", "prompt_leaks", "factual_errors",
           "continuity_errors", "expression_errors", "repair_actions",
           "forbidden_element_findings"}
  - Downstream Consumer: ChapterRepairStep / EditStep (for iterative repair)
Consumption Chain Priority: P0 (intra-chapter facts/identity/name consistency) > P1 (prompt leaks/factual errors)
              > P2 (expression errors/intra-chapter coherence)
Brief Example:
  Input: chapter_text="The next morning, Lin Yuan stood at the city gate...",
        canon_context={"characters":{"Lin Yuan":{"alive":true,"location":"city gate"}}}
  Output: {"risk_level":"medium","prompt_leaks":["next morning + protagonist name templated opening"],
         "factual_errors":[],"repair_actions":["Rewrite opening to avoid templated time marker"]}
================================================================================
